/*视频进度---声音进度---*/
/*视频横向进度条---start*/
#m_minihorSlider::groove:horizontal
{
background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
height: 1px;
border-radius:1px;
}

#m_minihorSlider::groove:horizontal:hover
{
background: qradialgradient(spread:pad, cx:0.5, cy:0.5, radius:0.5, fx:0.5, fy:0.5, 
stop:0.6 #45ADED, stop:0.778409 rgba(255, 255, 255, 255));
height: 2px;
border-radius:1px;
}

#m_minihorSlider::handle:horizontal 
{
background-color:qlineargradient(spread:pad,x1:0,y1:0,x2:1,y2:0,stop:0 rgba(0, 205, 76,1.0), stop:1  rgba(24, 247, 51,1.0));
height:8px;
width:8px;
margin-top: -4px;
margin-bottom: -4px;
border-radius:4px;
padding-right:1px;
}

#m_minihorSlider::handle:horizontal:hover 
{
background-color: red;
height:8px;
width:10px;
margin-top: -4px;
margin-bottom: -4px;
border-radius:5px;
}

#m_minihorSlider::add-page:horizontal,#m_minihorSlider::add-line:horizontal
{
border-radius:2px;
background-color:yellow;
}

#m_minihorSlider::sub-page:horizontal,#m_minihorSlider::sub-line:horizontal
{
border-radius:2px;
background-color:qlineargradient(spread:pad, x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:0, stop:0 rgba(231,80,229, 255), stop:1 rgba(7,208,255, 255));
}
/*视频横向进度条--end*/

/*声音纵向进度条---start*/
#m_miniverSlider::groove:vertical 
{
border: 1px solid #4A708B;
background: #C0C0C0;
width: 5px;
border-radius: 1px;
padding-left:-1px;
padding-right:-1px;
padding-top:-1px;
padding-bottom:-1px;
}

#m_miniverSlider::sub-page:vertical 
{
background: #575757;
border: 1px solid #4A708B;
border-radius: 2px;
}

#m_miniverSlider::add-page:vertical 
{
background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:0, y2:1, 
    stop:0 #c4c4c4, stop:1 #B1B1B1);
background: qlineargradient(x1: 0, y1: 0.2, x2: 1, y2: 1,
    stop: 0 #5DCCFF, stop: 1 #1874CD);
border: 0px solid #777;
width: 10px;
border-radius: 2px;
}

#m_miniverSlider::handle:vertical 
{
    background: qradialgradient(spread:pad, cx:0.5, cy:0.5, radius:0.5, fx:0.5, fy:0.5, stop:0.6 #45ADED, stop:0.778409 rgba(255, 255, 255, 255));
    height: 11px;
    margin-left: -3px;
    margin-right: -3px;
    border-radius: 5px;
}

#m_miniverSlider::sub-page:vertical:disabled 
{
background: #00009C;
border-color: #999;
}

#m_miniverSlider::add-page:vertical:disabled 
{
background: #eee;
border-color: #999;
}

#m_miniverSlider::handle:vertical:disabled 
{
background: #eee;
border: 1px solid #aaa;
border-radius: 4px;
}
/*声音纵向进度条---end*/

/*视频右键菜单*/
#m_mainVideoMenu,#m_miniVideoMenu,#m_miniSub1Menu,#m_miniSub2Menu
